}}Avellinia festucoides es una especie de planta herbácea perteneciente a la familia de las poáceas.

Other notable cultivars include:
 'Cardinal de Richelieu' (Parmentier pre-1847; withdrawn) – this rose was used as a starting point for genetic engineering to produce the first blue rose{{citation needed|date=June 2021}}
 'Complicata'
